## High-performance flexible self-powered strain sensor based on carbon nanotube/ZnSe/CoSe₂ nanocomposite film electrodes
Qiufan Wang<sup>1</sup>, Jiaheng Liu<sup>1</sup>, Xuan Ran<sup>1</sup>, Daohong Zhang<sup>1</sup>(✉), Guozhen Shen<sup>2</sup>(✉), and Menghe Miao<sup>3</sup>
